# CLAUDE.md.imports — overlay directive file (Class B-imports)
#
# Each non-comment, non-blank line is an @import that the overlay
# ensures is present in ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md. Deploy is idempotent:
# duplicates are skipped, missing entries are inserted after the
# last existing @-line (or appended at EOF if none).
#
# See Tools/deploy-overlay.sh (Class B-imports loop) and pai-v5#7.

@PAI/AISTEERINGRULES.md
